  "name": "EX Collector's Tins (2006)",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Three tins released in October 2006 with Kyogre, Groudon or Rayquaza on the lid. Each held two EX Crystal Guardians and two EX Emerald booster packs and the holofoil ex of the Pokémon on its tin: Kyogre ex 037, Groudon ex 038 or Rayquaza ex 039. Ryo Ueda's three cards began in Japan as Players Club promos, in the Limited Edition Starter Kit that club members could order by mail or buy at some official tournaments during the 2005 season.",
